t":"See a year of its breadth, every rebound and when it faded, and how each stock has done inside it. Leader flags mark stocks at 52-week highs while their industry is still well down."}],"state_how":{"washout":"Most of the industry has been sold. Look for a Thrust next: most stocks turning up together. A washout can last weeks, so on its own it says nothing about timing.","thrust_c":"Most of the industry's stocks turned up together after a washout. See whether it holds and moves on to Confirmed, or turns Fading.","thrust_cap":"Most of the industry's stocks turned up together after a sell-off in which almost all of them kept falling to the end. See whether it holds and moves on to Confirmed, or turns Fading.","confirmed":"Most of the industry's stocks are trending up together. This describes a trend already under way.","fading":"A rebound or uptrend has lost its breadth: fewer of the industry's stocks are taking part.","neutral":"None of the other states applies today. The bars show how many stocks are above their averages.","none":"Too few stocks pass the counting rules for a reading."},"disclaimer":"Describes price and breadth data for NSE industries. Not a recommendation to buy, sell or hold any security.","plan":"gold","locked":{}}